{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Hey Jon, what's been up? Some pretty cool stuff happened since we talked. I have acquired some new unique pieces for my store."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-f68cc0cb92f04525ea345084", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.671178+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f68cc0cb92f04525ea345084", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f68cc0cb92f04525ea345084", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Congrats on your store, Gina! Happy for you! It looks sick - is it a unique piece you're selling?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-b25631793d3cacbd91917389", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.699016+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b25631793d3cacbd91917389", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b25631793d3cacbd91917389", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks! This hoodie isn't for sale, it's from my own collection. I made a limited edition line last week to show off my style and creativity - it was tough but worth it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-a5d6b96df8777c2203e878fd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.727389+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a5d6b96df8777c2203e878fd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a5d6b96df8777c2203e878fd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: What gave you the idea?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-0b3f8aa56741046efea72e65", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.745082+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0b3f8aa56741046efea72e65", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0b3f8aa56741046efea72e65", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: This design reminds me of the grit it takes to stand out and face challenges."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-b0456564adafb32706dc84cd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.762737+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b0456564adafb32706dc84cd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b0456564adafb32706dc84cd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: That's awesome, Gina! Yesterday I chose to go to networking events to make things happen. It's been tough but I'm staying determined and focused."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-b4b7e8e187943aa5b332b8b6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.780036+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b4b7e8e187943aa5b332b8b6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b4b7e8e187943aa5b332b8b6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Way to go, Jon! Attending those networking events takes guts and drive. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-22b7a50d38e97f55ae96f335", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.796960+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "22b7a50d38e97f55ae96f335", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "22b7a50d38e97f55ae96f335", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! It's been tough going since I lost my job, but I'm sure investing my time in my business will pay off eventually. I really appreciate your help."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-8b5f69fba7a7f802d1fac489", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.813700+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8b5f69fba7a7f802d1fac489", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8b5f69fba7a7f802d1fac489", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: No worries, Jon! You got this! Let me know if you need anything."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-c1dfea51d7ba0f21fcb42d97", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.832474+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c1dfea51d7ba0f21fcb42d97", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c1dfea51d7ba0f21fcb42d97", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Your help matters to me. I am writing all my plans down."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-4ff5e14f88355a68210eb1b4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.865713+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4ff5e14f88355a68210eb1b4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4ff5e14f88355a68210eb1b4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Nice work! Tracking your plans and goals is key. It's like a picture of all your progress."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-7aab9a1aa6b95be4bc7500a1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.904261+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7aab9a1aa6b95be4bc7500a1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7aab9a1aa6b95be4bc7500a1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks, Gina! Seeing my goals written down on paper really helps keep me motivated and focused on what I have to do. I know it won't be easy, but I'm sure it'll pay off. Thanks for the support!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-abf2c007040b40eb89445416", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.939676+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "abf2c007040b40eb89445416", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "abf2c007040b40eb89445416", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: No worries, Jon! When things get rough, keep persevering and keep working hard. You'll get there! Don't quit!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-3c6ffd7bcc91c03ffd629a78", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.951656+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3c6ffd7bcc91c03ffd629a78", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3c6ffd7bcc91c03ffd629a78", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks, Gina! That sign reminds me to never give up, however hard things get. I'll keep going!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-f78dd47c0a9c1c86db6a5286", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.972435+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f78dd47c0a9c1c86db6a5286", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f78dd47c0a9c1c86db6a5286", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Believe in yourself and keep going. You can do it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-f89043f21e569db6e28214d0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:59.988971+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f89043f21e569db6e28214d0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f89043f21e569db6e28214d0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! I'm feeling confident and won't give up. Your support means a ton to me."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_16-be1994e48cdb47047b9bf717", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:10:00.001330+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "be1994e48cdb47047b9bf717", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "be1994e48cdb47047b9bf717", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
